graph TD
    BURST[500 Concurrent Worker Requests]
    QUEUE[Connection Pool Queue - max_overflow=20]
    SERIAL[Row Lock Serialization - Target Product]
    
    BURST --> QUEUE
    QUEUE --> SERIAL

    subgraph Outcome_Distribution [Transactional Invariant Results]
        OK[100 Confirmed Orders - Stock Deducted]
        REJ[400 Rejected Requests - 409 Conflict]
    end

    SERIAL -->|Initial Stock Available| OK
    SERIAL -->|Stock Exhausted| REJ
